 "name_en": "Quality Management for Complaints from Customers (2FA)",
 "description_en_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>Quality Management for Complaints from Customers (2FA)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loiod87a16622d8345109cb7ac7da33c9d91\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loiod87a16622d8345109cb7ac7da33c9d91__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Overview</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">This scope item describes the management of customer complaints, for example, after delivery of a product. Using quality notifications, the quality engineer can capture all complaint-related information provided by the customer. The quality engineer enriches the notification by adding internal logistical information, such as delivery and purchase documents. Further immediate actions can be captured for documentation purposes. To identify the complaint's root cause, the engineer documents a root cause analysis. After having identified the error and the related root cause, the quality engineer classifies this information using code groups, codes, and free text information.</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">The quality engineer defines corrective and preventive actions either globally at notification level or per defect. The engineer assigns one processor to each action. The action is processed, and action processors give feedback per action.</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">Finally, the quality engineer reviews each action and closes the notification.</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loiod87a16622d8345109cb7ac7da33c9d91__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Key Process Flow</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Create quality notification with basic data</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Capture defects, define root cause analysis, and document immediate actions</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Define corrective actions and correction tasks</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Execute root cause analysis, corrective actions, correction tasks, and document outcome</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Review root cause analysis and document root cause, review corrective actions, and review correction tasks</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Define preventive actions</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Execute preventive actions and document outcome</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Review preventive actions</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Complete quality notification</li>\n      </ul>\n      <p class=\"p\"></p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loiod87a16622d8345109cb7ac7da33c9d91__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Business Benefits</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Capture complaint details, related defects, causes, and activities in one place</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Manage different types of activities (for example immediate, corrective, and preventive actions)</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Assign a person responsible to each action and track action status and outcome</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
 "description_zh_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>客户投诉质量管理 (2FA)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loiod87a16622d8345109cb7ac7da33c9d91\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loiod87a16622d8345109cb7ac7da33c9d91__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">概览</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">此范围项目描述了客户投诉的管理，例如，在产品交付后。使用质量通知，质量工程师可以捕获客户提供的所有投诉相关信息。质量工程师通过添加内部物流信息（例如交货和采购凭证）丰富通知。可以捕获更多即时操作以进行记录。为确定投诉的根本原因，工程师记录根本原因分析。确定错误和相关根本原因后，质量工程师使用代码组、代码和自由文本信息对此信息进行分类。</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">质量工程师在全局通知级别或按缺陷定义更正和预防操作。工程师为每个操作分配一个处理人。操作得到处理，操作处理人按操作给出反馈。</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">最后，质量工程师审核每个操作并关闭通知。</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loiod87a16622d8345109cb7ac7da33c9d91__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">关键流程流</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">使用基本数据创建质量通知</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">捕获缺陷、定义根本原因分析并记录立即操作</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">定义更正操作和更正任务</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">执行根本原因分析、纠正措施、纠正任务并记录结果</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">查看根本原因分析并记录根本原因，查看纠正措施并查看更正任务</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">定义预防措施</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">执行预防措施并记录结果</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">检查预防措施</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">完成质量通知</li>\n      </ul>\n      <p class=\"p\"></p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loiod87a16622d8345109cb7ac7da33c9d91__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">业务优势</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">在一个位置捕获投诉详细信息、相关缺陷、原因和活动</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">管理不同类型的活动（例如，立即、纠正和预防措施）</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">为每个操作分配负责人，并跟踪操作状态和结果</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
